He went to Pilate and asked for Jesus' body. Pilate ordered that it be given to him.
God Joseph took the body and wrapped it in a clean shroud.
He placed it in his new tomb which he had carved out of the rock. He rolled a large stone in front of the entrance to the tomb. Then he went away.
